#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "Monthly Quota"
msgstr "Quota mensuel"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid ""
"Set a quota per interface based only on its own traffic, or a global quota "
"combining several interfaces. When a quota is reached, every interface it "
"covers is cut or throttled together for the remainder of the month."
msgstr ""
"Configurez un quota par interface basé uniquement sur son propre trafic, ou "
"un quota global combinant plusieurs interfaces. Quand un quota est atteint, "
"chaque interface qu'il couvre est désactivée ou bridée ensemble pour le "
"reste du mois."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "Interfaces"
msgstr "Interfaces"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "Add interface…"
msgstr "Ajouter une interface…"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "-- select interface --"
msgstr "-- sélectionner une interface --"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "Add"
msgstr "Ajouter"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "Enable"
msgstr "Activer"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "TX quota (KiB)"
msgstr "Quota de transmission (TX en Kio)"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "RX quota (KiB)"
msgstr "Quota de réception (RX en Kio)"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "TX+RX quota (KiB)"
msgstr "Quota de transmission+réception (TX+RX en Kio)"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "Begin date"
msgstr "Date de début"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "End date"
msgstr "Date de fin"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "Interval between checks (s)"
msgstr "Intervalle entre les vérifications (s)"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "Daily budget method"
msgstr "Méthode de budget quotidien"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/graphs.js
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Désactivé"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "Block when the interval budget is exceeded"
msgstr "Bloquer lorsque le budget de l'intervalle est dépassé"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "Limit speed using remaining daily volume"
msgstr "Limiter le débit selon le volume quotidien restant"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "Budget threshold (%)"
msgstr "Seuil de budget (%)"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "Budget calculation interval (s)"
msgstr "Intervalle de calcul du budget (s)"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "Downstream limit interfaces"
msgstr "Interfaces limitées en aval"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid ""
"Space-separated interfaces shaped by the daily budget speed-limit method. "
"Leave empty to use this section interface."
msgstr ""
"Interfaces, séparées par des espaces, limitées par la méthode de limitation "
"de débit du budget quotidien. Laisser vide pour utiliser l'interface de "
"cette section."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "Action when quota is reached"
msgstr "Action lorsque le quota est atteint"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "Cut — bring interface(s) down for the rest of the month"
msgstr "Couper — arrêter la ou les interfaces pour le reste du mois"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "Throttle — limit interface(s) bandwidth"
msgstr "Limiter — restreindre la bande passante de la ou des interfaces"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "Block LAN and proxy when cut"
msgstr "Bloquer le LAN et le proxy lors de la coupure"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid ""
"Block LAN traffic while the quota is exceeded: firewall LAN input is set to "
"DROP, which stops every transparent proxy without changing proxy service "
"state, and forwarded LAN traffic is rejected, which stops bypassed flows and"
" the VPN tunnel. The router itself stays reachable from the LAN (LuCI, SSH, "
"DNS, DHCP, ping) and LAN to LAN traffic keeps working."
msgstr ""
"Bloque le trafic LAN tant que le quota est dépassé : l'entrée LAN du pare-"
"feu est mise à DROP, ce qui arrête tous les proxys transparents sans "
"modifier l'état de leur service, et le trafic LAN routé est rejeté, ce qui "
"arrête les flux contournés et le tunnel VPN. Le routeur lui-même reste "
"joignable depuis le LAN (LuCI, SSH, DNS, DHCP, ping) et le trafic de LAN à "
"LAN continue de fonctionner."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "Download limit (Mbps)"
msgstr "Limite de téléchargement (Mbit/s)"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid ""
"Maximum download speed applied to the interface(s) when quota is exceeded"
msgstr ""
"Débit descendant maximal appliqué à la ou aux interfaces lorsque le quota "
"est dépassé"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "Upload limit (Mbps)"
msgstr "Limite d'envoi (Mbit/s)"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid ""
"Maximum upload speed applied to the interface(s) when quota is exceeded"
msgstr ""
"Débit montant maximal appliqué à la ou aux interfaces lorsque le quota est "
"dépassé"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "Enforcement scope"
msgstr "Portée de l'application"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "This month only — auto-recover when the month resets"
msgstr ""
"Ce mois uniquement — rétablissement automatique à la remise à zéro du mois"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "All future months — keep cut/throttled until manually reset"
msgstr ""
"Tous les mois suivants — rester coupé/limité jusqu'à une remise à zéro "
"manuelle"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "Reset exceeded state"
msgstr "Réinitialiser l'état de dépassement"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid ""
"Tick and save to clear the persistent exceeded flag — the interface(s) "
"recover on the next check interval"
msgstr ""
"Cochez et enregistrez pour effacer l'indicateur de dépassement persistant — "
"la ou les interfaces se rétablissent à la prochaine vérification"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "Global quota"
msgstr "Quota global"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid ""
"A quota combining the traffic of several interfaces. When it is reached, "
"every interface listed below is cut or throttled together."
msgstr ""
"Un quota combinant le trafic de plusieurs interfaces. Lorsqu'il est atteint,"
" toutes les interfaces listées ci-dessous sont coupées ou limitées ensemble."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "Add global quota…"
msgstr "Ajouter un quota global…"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid ""
"Space-separated interfaces whose combined traffic counts towards this quota."
" All of them are cut or throttled together when the quota is reached."
msgstr ""
"Interfaces, séparées par des espaces, dont le trafic cumulé compte pour ce "
"quota. Toutes sont coupées ou limitées ensemble lorsque le quota est "
"atteint."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid ""
"Space-separated interfaces shaped by the daily budget speed-limit method. "
"Leave empty to shape all interfaces listed above."
msgstr ""
"Interfaces, séparées par des espaces, limitées par la méthode de limitation "
"de débit du budget quotidien. Laisser vide pour limiter toutes les "
"interfaces listées ci-dessus."

